# Host-side configuration lives in ~/.config/agent-box and is MOUNTED into the
# VM read-only, never copied in here — see docs/decisions.md. These entries stay
# as a backstop: none of these names is generic, so none is ever committable,
# and .local/ remains available for local scratch.
.local/

# Belt and braces: these names must never be committed even at the repo root.
*.token
allowlist.local
blocklist.txt
ca.pem

.DS_Store
